        <item>
            <title>261012.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 22:28:29 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cxa/yiyan</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/cxa/yiyan/blob/main/RELEASE_NOTES.md</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>2610.12.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>261012.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### 更新内容

- 不再把只有终端命令的输入收进学习记录，连续执行的多条命令也会忽略；命令旁的文字说明仍正常采集。

### What’s new

- Inputs containing only terminal commands are no longer collected as learning records, including multiple commands run together. Accompanying explanations are still collected.
]]></description>
